  "name": "Feel++",
  "description": "Feel++ is an open-source C++ framework for continuous and discontinuous Galerkin methods (FEM/SEM/DG/HDG) and reduced basis methods for parallel PDE simulation in 1D-3D. It includes toolboxes for multiphysics applications (CFD, CSM, heat transfer, FSI, thermo-electric, Maxwell) and model order reduction components.",
